# RESPONSE

GameMode: DefaultEngine.ini sets GlobalDefaultGameMode=/Game/Blueprints/BP_GrantMoneyGameMode.BP_GrantMoneyGameMode_C. The map is PlayGame1.
The C++ parent is presumably AGrantMoneyGameMode, an empty AGameModeBase subclass with no constructor.
So nothing is set in C++, and the classes must be set in the Blueprint's defaults.
The PlayGame1 map could also override the GameMode in World Settings. I can't tell from here.
PlayerController: Almost certainly AMapCameraPlayerController, set in the BP.
Camera owner: AMapCameraPawn is a plain APawn.
It has a SceneRoot, then a SpringArm, then a Camera, with no collision and no movement component.
Perspective projection and mouse-driven yaw/pitch/zoom are driven manually in Tick.